Floating eyes are probably that dangerous for "game balance" (IMHO to be sure).
Otherwise, they make it too easy to get a highly useful intrinsic.
But they appear at very low levels where the long paralization is
normally fatal.  Perhaps eyes should be less agressive at initial
levels, and more agressive the deeper you go, so that hackers who
play safe ("Do you really want to attack the floating eye?") can
be slightly protected from such an accident.

